If Patricia enters the Schengen Area on March 1, 2025, what is the last date she is allowed to still be present in the Schengen Area before she must exit to stay compliant with the 90/180 rule? Give a specific date and briefly explain your reasoning, including whether entry and exit days themselves count toward the 90 days.</pre>
