        Over time it gets lost and you can't share it with your travel group, see everyone's days side
        by side, or update it when plans change. Meanwhile, the official EU calculator
        is always accurate, but it handles one traveler at a time,
        can't answer complicated scheduling questions, and does not support other countries outside the Schengen Area.
      </p>

      <p>
        By comparison, <a href="/app">EuroVisaCalculator</a> is built to be shared, supports the entire continent, and is meant for multiple travelers.
